{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "p360-api-v1-bearer",
    "name": "Paciente360 API v1 (Bearer)",
    "description": "Coleção oficial da API REST do Paciente360 — Fase 4 Token Auth Migration.\n\n## Autenticação\n\n- `POST /auth/login` — emite Bearer Sanctum token. Salva automaticamente em `{{token}}` e o `slug` do tenant em `{{tenant_slug}}` via post-response script.\n- Demais requests injetam `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` + `X-Tenant-Slug: {{tenant_slug}}` via pre-request script (collection-level).\n\nO header `X-Tenant-Slug` é obrigatório em rotas autenticadas (exceto `/auth/login`) — triple-check anti-token-roubo cross-tenant (FR-011 / Princípio II).\n\n## Variáveis\n\n- `base_url` — default `http://api.lvh.me/api/v1` (dev local)\n- `token` — preenchido automaticamente pelo login\n- `tenant_slug` — preenchido automaticamente pelo login\n- `email`, `password` — credenciais usadas no login (substitua pelos seus)\n\n## Renovação\n\nTokens expiram em 30 dias. *Sliding expiration* renova `expires_at` em toda request quando restam < 5 dias — sem ação do cliente.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Pre-request script (collection-level) — injeta Authorization + X-Tenant-Slug",
          "// em TODAS as requests da coleção (exceto rotas com {{noAuth}} no path).",
          "//",
          "// Para pular a injeção em uma request específica, defina a variável local",
          "// `skipAuth = true` antes do envio.",
          "if (pm.variables.get('skipAuth')) { return; }",
          "",
          "const token = pm.collectionVariables.get('token');",
          "const tenantSlug = pm.collectionVariables.get('tenant_slug');",
          "",
          "if (token) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: `Bearer ${token}` });",
          "}",
          "if (tenantSlug) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Tenant-Slug', value: tenantSlug });",
          "}",
          "",
          "// Correlação para debug — backend ecoa este X-Request-Id em log + Sentry.",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({",
          "    key: 'X-Request-Id',",
          "    value: 'postman-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 10),",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://api.lvh.me/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tenant_slug", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "admin@clinica-alfa.com.br", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "p@ssw0rd123", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Endpoints de autenticação Bearer Sanctum.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// /auth/login não exige Authorization nem X-Tenant-Slug.",
                  "pm.variables.set('skipAuth', true);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-salva token + tenant.slug em variáveis da coleção",
                  "// para que as próximas requests injetem automaticamente.",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201 || pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (body.tenant && body.tenant.slug) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('tenant_slug', body.tenant.slug);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_name\": \"Postman\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 204) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/logout-all",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout-all",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout-all"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 204) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/tokens",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/tokens",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "tokens"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /auth/tokens/{id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/tokens/:tokenId",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "tokens", ":tokenId"],
              "variable": [
                { "key": "tokenId", "value": "1", "description": "Id do token (de GET /auth/tokens)" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Broadcasting",
      "description": "Autorização de canais Reverb com Bearer (US3 — Lote F).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /broadcasting/auth",
          "description": "Autoriza subscription em canal privado/presence. Backend valida Bearer + X-Tenant-Slug + channel callback (routes/channels.php).",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/../broadcasting/auth",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["..", "broadcasting", "auth"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "socket_id", "value": "1234.5678" },
                { "key": "channel_name", "value": "private-tenant.1.user.1" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
